    "type": "game",
    "name": "Remnants Of Yore",
    "steam_appid": 3653850,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/1c328461cc8f0bffe75aaa562133c11c.avif?t=1746126142\" width=678 height=106 /></span>In a small lost village of Saer something strange is happening. The forest near the village has been corrupted by an unknown force and is affecting the village, preventing people from leaving it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Yore, a wizard cat specialized in magic through plants, stumbled in the village and got trapped within. After wandering through the dilapidated town, Yore finds an abandoned antique store that he decides to call home. There he discovers his ability to see spirits, trapped in objects, some of which seem to be related to the corruption of the nearby forest.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoning up his courage, Yore decides to explore the nearby forest and, with the help of the villagers, find out the root of this corruption and save it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/c7e5f8bbc9fa1456d40eda7981a3c32d.poster.avif?t=1746126142\" width=798 height=431 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/c7e5f8bbc9fa1456d40eda7981a3c32d.webm?t=1746126142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/10c40f78dfbc7ad5b2fa0aba853ed293.avif?t=1746126142\" width=678 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage stock, upgrade your antique shop and attract customers! You can sell the rare artifacts and antiques that you come across within the forest, learn the stories of the spirits trapped within and free them or keep them and gain powerful boons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/5c4756560ba57887326e60f5bcb94bfb.poster.avif?t=1746126142\" width=675 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/5c4756560ba57887326e60f5bcb94bfb.webm?t=1746126142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/a50db90e0e160b9a94addd364723ecae.avif?t=1746126142\" width=800 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go deep into the forest and discover its secrets. The further you go, the further the story progresses! Each attempt is totally different from the previous one, with new enemies, items, powers and zones. But beware, if you are defeated, you will lose much of your progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/152bb9deebc704f7318341ccaa922b8b.poster.avif?t=1746126142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/152bb9deebc704f7318341ccaa922b8b.webm?t=1746126142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/24208c96cbcb985fa968c6b6b997e6d1.avif?t=1746126142\" width=678 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you settle into your new life in the crumbling town, you'll meet a colorful cast of characters, each with their own hopes, regrets, and mysteries to uncover. Spend time getting to know the townsfolk by helping them with daily tasks, completing personal quests, and sharing gifts crafted from the herbs and relics you find on your journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/8df728c7e5b8a8cbae8ec6ca8a166a91.avif?t=1746126142\" width=800 height=498 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/8427f32aa560bee453bc567587835456.avif?t=1746126142\" width=678 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town has grown quiet and tired over the years, but it still holds a spark of life. Gather special materials to help the townsfolk restore their shops and homes, bringing back the charm and warmth it once had. Unlocks new stories, new friendships, and a brighter future for everyone who calls the town home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/50856d5b1ee32593c58ae32d075d6665.poster.avif?t=1746126142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/50856d5b1ee32593c58ae32d075d6665.webm?t=1746126142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/bd1e59622ce92ce3fd662a31b3b6864a.avif?t=1746126142\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/6c08890555c75314fb514dbc37275aa8.avif?t=1746126142\" width=678 height=106 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/1c328461cc8f0bffe75aaa562133c11c.avif?t=1746126142\" width=678 height=106 /></span>In a small lost village of Saer something strange is happening. The forest near the village has been corrupted by an unknown force and is affecting the village, preventing people from leaving it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Yore, a wizard cat specialized in magic through plants, stumbled in the village and got trapped within. After wandering through the dilapidated town, Yore finds an abandoned antique store that he decides to call home. There he discovers his ability to see spirits, trapped in objects, some of which seem to be related to the corruption of the nearby forest.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoning up his courage, Yore decides to explore the nearby forest and, with the help of the villagers, find out the root of this corruption and save it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/c7e5f8bbc9fa1456d40eda7981a3c32d.poster.avif?t=1746126142\" width=798 height=431 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/c7e5f8bbc9fa1456d40eda7981a3c32d.webm?t=1746126142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/10c40f78dfbc7ad5b2fa0aba853ed293.avif?t=1746126142\" width=678 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage stock, upgrade your antique shop and attract customers! You can sell the rare artifacts and antiques that you come across within the forest, learn the stories of the spirits trapped within and free them or keep them and gain powerful boons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/5c4756560ba57887326e60f5bcb94bfb.poster.avif?t=1746126142\" width=675 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/5c4756560ba57887326e60f5bcb94bfb.webm?t=1746126142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/a50db90e0e160b9a94addd364723ecae.avif?t=1746126142\" width=800 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go deep into the forest and discover its secrets. The further you go, the further the story progresses! Each attempt is totally different from the previous one, with new enemies, items, powers and zones. But beware, if you are defeated, you will lose much of your progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/152bb9deebc704f7318341ccaa922b8b.poster.avif?t=1746126142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/152bb9deebc704f7318341ccaa922b8b.webm?t=1746126142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/24208c96cbcb985fa968c6b6b997e6d1.avif?t=1746126142\" width=678 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you settle into your new life in the crumbling town, you'll meet a colorful cast of characters, each with their own hopes, regrets, and mysteries to uncover. Spend time getting to know the townsfolk by helping them with daily tasks, completing personal quests, and sharing gifts crafted from the herbs and relics you find on your journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/8df728c7e5b8a8cbae8ec6ca8a166a91.avif?t=1746126142\" width=800 height=498 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/8427f32aa560bee453bc567587835456.avif?t=1746126142\" width=678 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town has grown quiet and tired over the years, but it still holds a spark of life. Gather special materials to help the townsfolk restore their shops and homes, bringing back the charm and warmth it once had. Unlocks new stories, new friendships, and a brighter future for everyone who calls the town home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/50856d5b1ee32593c58ae32d075d6665.poster.avif?t=1746126142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/50856d5b1ee32593c58ae32d075d6665.webm?t=1746126142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/bd1e59622ce92ce3fd662a31b3b6864a.avif?t=1746126142\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/extras/6c08890555c75314fb514dbc37275aa8.avif?t=1746126142\" width=678 height=106 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A cozy rogue-like adventure about spirits, spellcraft, and second chances. You are the proud new owner of a once thriving, now dilapidated antique shop! After your arrival, it\u2019s quite obvious that something is wrong\u2026 but none of the remaining town folk can figure out what...",
